  <note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895"><foreign xml:lang="ger"><abbr>Empf.</abbr> den 6.<hi rend="sup">ten</hi></foreign></note>

  <p>Mi capita oggi l’occluso <rs type="letter">letterone</rs>,
      <lb/>e subito glelo spedisco. Mi sarà
